"The base is `debian:bookworm-slim` with no extra system packages. Even `ca-"
"certificates` is unnecessary, because the TLS root certificates are embedded "
"in the binary."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:3
msgid ""
"[インストール](install.md)が済んでいる前提で、1枚出すところから改ページまでを"
"順に試します。"
msgstr ""
"Assuming you have finished [installing](install.md), this page walks from a "
"single page through to page breaks."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:5
msgid "1. 変換する"
msgstr "1. Convert"

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:7
msgid "`hello.html`を用意します。"
msgstr "Start with a `hello.html`."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:9
msgid ""
"```\n"
"<!DOCTYPE html>\n"
"<html>\n"
"  <head>\n"
"    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n"
"    <style>\n"
"      body { font-family: sans-serif; }\n"
"      h1 { border-bottom: 2px solid #333; padding-bottom: 8px; }\n"
"      .total { text-align: right; font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; }\n"
"    </style>\n"
"  </head>\n"
"  <body>\n"
"    <h1>請求書</h1>\n"
"    <p>いつもお世話になっております。下記のとおりご請求申し上げます。</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"total\">合計 ¥12,000</p>\n"
"  </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"<!DOCTYPE html>\n"
"<html>\n"
"  <head>\n"
"    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n"
"    <style>\n"
"      body { font-family: sans-serif; }\n"
"      h1 { border-bottom: 2px solid #333; padding-bottom: 8px; }\n"
"      .total { text-align: right; font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; }\n"
"    </style>\n"
"  </head>\n"
"  <body>\n"
"    <h1>Invoice</h1>\n"
"    <p>Thank you for your continued business. Please find the charges below."
"</p>\n"
"    <p class=\"total\">Total 12,000 JPY</p>\n"
"  </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
"```"

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:28
msgid "変換します。"
msgstr "Then convert it."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:34
msgid ""
"出力先(`-o`)を省略すると、入力の拡張子を`.pdf`にしたファイル名になります。 `-"
"`を使うと標準入力から読み、標準出力へ書けます。"
msgstr ""
"Without `-o`, the output file is the input name with the extension changed "
"to `.pdf`. Use `-` to read from standard input and write to standard output."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:41
msgid "2. 用紙と余白を決める"
msgstr "2. Choose the paper and margins"

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:48
msgid "単位は`mm`/`cm`/`in`/`pt`/`px`が使え、省略すると`mm`です。"
msgstr ""
"The units `mm`, `cm`, `in`, `pt`, and `px` are accepted, and a bare number "
"means `mm`."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:50
msgid ""
"同じことはCSSの`@page`でも書けます。 両方書いた場合はCSSが勝ちます(CLIオプ"
"ションは初期値として扱われます)。 wkhtmltopdfと逆なので、移行時は[wkhtmltopdf"
"からの移行](../migration/wkhtmltopdf.md)を確認してください。"
msgstr ""
"The same thing can be written in CSS with `@page`. If you write both, the "
"CSS wins; the CLI options are treated as initial values. This is the "
"opposite of wkhtmltopdf, so check [Migrating from wkhtmltopdf](../migration/"
"wkhtmltopdf.md) when you move over."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:61
msgid "3. 改ページする"
msgstr "3. Break pages"

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:63
msgid "「ここから次のページ」は、CSSの`break-before`で指定します。"
msgstr ""
"\"Start a new page here\" is expressed with the CSS property `break-before`."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:65
msgid ""
"```\n"
"<style>\n"
"  .page-break { break-before: page; }\n"
"</style>\n"
"\n"
"<h1>請求書</h1>\n"
"<p>1ページ目です。</p>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"page-break\">\n"
"  <h1>明細</h1>\n"
"  <p>2ページ目です。</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"<style>\n"
"  .page-break { break-before: page; }\n"
"</style>\n"
"\n"
"<h1>Invoice</h1>\n"
"<p>This is page 1.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"page-break\">\n"
"  <h1>Line items</h1>\n"
"  <p>This is page 2.</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"```"

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:79
msgid ""
"`break-after`(この要素の後で改ページ)、`break-inside: avoid`(この要素を分割し"
"ない)も使えます。 見出しだけが行末に取り残されるのを防ぐ`orphans`/`widows`も"
"あります。 詳しくは[ページ分割](../supports/pagination.md)を参照してくださ"
"い。"
msgstr ""
"`break-after`, which breaks after the element, and `break-inside: avoid`, "
"which keeps the element in one piece, are available too. So are `orphans` "
"and `widows`, which stop a single line from being stranded at a page "
"boundary. See [Page breaks](../supports/pagination.md) for details."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:83
msgid "4. ヘッダーとフッターを付ける"
msgstr "4. Add headers and footers"

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:85
msgid ""
"```\n"
"sghtmltopdf hello.html -o hello.pdf \\\n"
"  --header-center \"請求書\" \\\n"
"  --footer-right \"[page] / [topage]\" \\\n"
"  --header-line\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"sghtmltopdf hello.html -o hello.pdf \\\n"
"  --header-center \"Invoice\" \\\n"
"  --footer-right \"[page] / [topage]\" \\\n"
"  --header-line\n"
"```"

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:92
msgid ""
"`[page]`は現在のページ番号、`[topage]`は総ページ数に置き換わります。 "
"JavaScriptは実行しないため、この置換で表現します。 HTMLでヘッダーを作りたい場"
"合は`--header-html`が使えます。"
msgstr ""
"`[page]` is replaced with the current page number and `[topage]` with the "
"total page count. JavaScript is never executed, so these placeholders take "
"its place. If you would rather build the header in HTML, use `--header-html`."

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:96
msgid "5. フォントを固定する"
msgstr "5. Pin the fonts"

#: src/getting-started/first-pdf.md:98
msgid ""
"ここまでの例はシステムのフォントを使っています。 サーバやCIで出力を環境に依存"
"させたくない場合は、フォントファイルを明示してください。"
msgstr ""
"The examples so far use whatever fonts the system has. On a server or in CI, "
"where you do not want the output to depend on the environment, name the font "
"files explicitly."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:1
msgid "CLIリファレンス"
msgstr "CLI reference"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:3
