msgstr ""
"The first converts a file; the second runs the [HTTP server](../server.md)."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:12
msgid ""
"wkhtmltopdfのオプションとの対応(非対応にしたものを含む全一覧)は[wkhtmltopdfオ"
"プション対応表](../../migration/wkhtmltopdf-options.md)を参照してください。"
msgstr ""
"For how these map to wkhtmltopdf's options, including the full list of the "
"ones that are not supported, see the [wkhtmltopdf option mapping](../../"
"migration/wkhtmltopdf-options.md)."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:14 src/usage/ruby_rails.md:30
