#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:31
msgid "`<INPUT.HTML>`"
msgstr "`<INPUT.HTML>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:31
msgid "(必須)"
msgstr "(required)"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:31
msgid "入力HTML。`-`で標準入力"
msgstr "The input HTML; `-` means standard input"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:32
msgid "`-o`, `--output <PATH>`"
msgstr "`-o`, `--output <PATH>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:32
msgid "入力の拡張子を`.pdf`に"
msgstr "The input name with `.pdf`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:32
msgid "出力先。`-`で標準出力。標準入力から読む場合は省略できない"
msgstr ""
"Where to write. `-` means standard output. It cannot be omitted when reading "
"from standard input"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:33
msgid "`--base-url <URL\\|DIR>`"
msgstr "`--base-url <URL\\|DIR>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:33
msgid "入力HTMLのあるディレクトリ"
msgstr "The directory of the input HTML"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:33
msgid ""
"相対参照の解決基準。http(s)のURLを渡すと`<base href>`の既定値になる(HTML内の"
"`<base href>`が優先)"
msgstr ""
"The base for resolving relative references. An http(s) URL becomes the "
"default `<base href>`; a `<base href>` in the HTML wins"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:34
msgid "`--encoding <NAME>`"
msgstr "`--encoding <NAME>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:34
msgid "自動判定"
msgstr "Detected"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:34
msgid ""
"入力の文字エンコーディング。判定順は BOM > `--encoding` > `<meta charset>` > "
"UTF-8"
msgstr ""
"The character encoding of the input. The order is BOM, then `--encoding`, "
"then `<meta charset>`, then UTF-8"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:35 src/usage/cli/streaming.md:56
#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf-options.md:158
msgid "`--streaming`"
msgstr "`--streaming`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:35 src/usage/cli/reference.md:85
#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:86 src/usage/cli/reference.md:161
msgid "オフ"
msgstr "Off"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:35
msgid "[ストリーミングモード](streaming.md)で処理する"
msgstr "Process in [streaming mode](streaming.md)"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:37
msgid ""
"出力ファイルは一時ファイルへ書いてから`rename`されるため、失敗したときに壊れ"
"たPDFが残ることはありません。"
msgstr ""
"The output is written to a temporary file and then renamed, so a failure "
"never leaves a broken PDF behind."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:39
msgid "ページ設定"
msgstr "Page setup"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:43
msgid "`-s`, `--page-size <SIZE>`"
msgstr "`-s`, `--page-size <SIZE>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:43
msgid "A4"
msgstr "A4"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:43
msgid "`A3`/`A4`/`A5`/`Letter`/`Legal`(大文字小文字を区別しない)"
msgstr "`A3`, `A4`, `A5`, `Letter`, or `Legal`, case insensitive"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:44
msgid "`--page-width <LENGTH>`"
msgstr "`--page-width <LENGTH>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:44
msgid "用紙の幅。`--page-size`より優先"
msgstr "The paper width; takes precedence over `--page-size`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:45
msgid "`--page-height <LENGTH>`"
msgstr "`--page-height <LENGTH>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:45
msgid "用紙の高さ。`--page-size`より優先"
msgstr "The paper height; takes precedence over `--page-size`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:46
msgid "`-O`, `--orientation <O>`"
msgstr "`-O`, `--orientation <O>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:46
msgid "Portrait"
msgstr "Portrait"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:46
msgid "`Landscape`は最後に幅と高さを入れ替える"
msgstr "`Landscape` swaps width and height at the end"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:47
msgid "`-T`, `--margin-top <LENGTH>`"
msgstr "`-T`, `--margin-top <LENGTH>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:47
msgid "1in (96px)"
msgstr "1in (96px)"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:47
msgid "上マージン"
msgstr "Top margin"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:48
msgid "`-B`, `--margin-bottom <LENGTH>`"
msgstr "`-B`, `--margin-bottom <LENGTH>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:48 src/usage/cli/reference.md:49
#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:50
msgid "1in"
msgstr "1in"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:48
msgid "下マージン"
msgstr "Bottom margin"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:49
msgid "`-L`, `--margin-left <LENGTH>`"
msgstr "`-L`, `--margin-left <LENGTH>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:49
msgid "左マージン"
msgstr "Left margin"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:50
msgid "`-R`, `--margin-right <LENGTH>`"
msgstr "`-R`, `--margin-right <LENGTH>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:50
msgid "右マージン"
msgstr "Right margin"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:52
msgid ""
"長さの単位は`mm`/`cm`/`in`/`pt`/`px`。 単位を省略するとmmです(wkhtmltopdf互"
"換)。"
msgstr ""
"Lengths take the units `mm`, `cm`, `in`, `pt`, and `px`. A bare number means "
"mm, as in wkhtmltopdf."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:55
msgid "CSSの`@page`との関係"
msgstr "How this relates to `@page` in CSS"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:57
msgid ""
"これらのオプションは初期値であり、HTMLのCSSに`@page { size: … }`や`@page "
"{ margin: … }`が書かれていればそちらが勝ちます(プロパティ単位)。 wkhtmltopdf"
"とは逆なので注意してください。"
msgstr ""
"These options are initial values. If the CSS in the HTML says `@page { size: "
"… }` or `@page { margin: … }`, the CSS wins, property by property. Note that "
"this is the opposite of wkhtmltopdf."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:64
msgid "`--font <PATH>`"
msgstr "`--font <PATH>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:64
msgid "使うフォント(複数指定可)。省略するとシステムフォントを使う"
msgstr ""
"The font to use; may be given more than once. Without it, system fonts are "
"used"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:65
msgid "`--font-index <N>`"
msgstr "`--font-index <N>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:65
msgid "直前の`--font`に対する、TrueType Collection(`.ttc`)内のフェイス番号"
msgstr ""
"The face index inside a TrueType Collection (`.ttc`), for the preceding `--"
"font`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:66
msgid "`--gothic-font <PATH>` (+`--gothic-font-index`)"
msgstr "`--gothic-font <PATH>` (with `--gothic-font-index`)"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:66
msgid "`font-family: sans-serif`の実体"
msgstr "The font behind `font-family: sans-serif`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:67
msgid "`--serif-font <PATH>` (+`--serif-font-index`)"
msgstr "`--serif-font <PATH>` (with `--serif-font-index`)"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:67
msgid "`font-family: serif`の実体"
msgstr "The font behind `font-family: serif`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:68
msgid "`--mono-font <PATH>` (+`--mono-font-index`)"
msgstr "`--mono-font <PATH>` (with `--mono-font-index`)"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:68
msgid "`font-family: monospace`の実体"
msgstr "The font behind `font-family: monospace`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:70
msgid ""
"フォントの解決順は「`--font` → `@font-face` → `font-family`名でのシステム探"
"索」。 それでも1つも見つからない場合だけ、システムの`sans-serif`候補が既定"
"フォントになります。"
msgstr ""
"Fonts are resolved in the order `--font`, then `@font-face`, then a system "
"search by `font-family` name. Only if none of those finds anything does a "
"system sans-serif candidate become the default font."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:73
msgid ""
"`--font`を指定しないと出力が実行環境のフォントに依存します。 サーバ運用やCIで"
"出力を安定させたい場合は`--font`(または`@font-face`)を明示してください。 詳し"
"くは[フォント](../../supports/fonts.md)を参照。"
msgstr ""
"Without `--font`, the output depends on the fonts of the machine it runs on. "
"To keep output stable on a server or in CI, name the fonts with `--font` or "
"`@font-face`. See [Fonts](../../supports/fonts.md) for details."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:77
msgid "PDFの出力形式・メタデータ"
msgstr "PDF output and metadata"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:81
msgid "`--title <TEXT>`"
msgstr "`--title <TEXT>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:81
msgid "HTMLの`<title>`"
msgstr "The `<title>` of the HTML"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:81
msgid "PDFの`/Title`"
msgstr "The `/Title` of the PDF"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:82
msgid "`--author` / `--subject` / `--keywords <TEXT>`"
msgstr "`--author`, `--subject`, `--keywords <TEXT>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:82
msgid "Info辞書の各項目(sghtmltopdf独自)"
msgstr "The matching entries of the Info dictionary; specific to sghtmltopdf"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:83
msgid "`-d`, `--dpi <DPI>`"
msgstr "`-d`, `--dpi <DPI>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:83
msgid "96"
msgstr "96"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:83
msgid "CSS pxを何dpiとして解釈するか。`72`にすると1px=1pt"
msgstr "How many dpi a CSS px stands for. At `72`, 1px equals 1pt"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:84
msgid "`--zoom <FACTOR>`"
msgstr "`--zoom <FACTOR>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:84
msgid "1.0"
msgstr "1.0"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:84
msgid "拡大率。`--dpi`の係数に掛かる"
msgstr "A scale factor, multiplied into the `--dpi` factor"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:85
msgid "`-g`, `--grayscale`"
msgstr "`-g`, `--grayscale`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:85
msgid "塗り・線をグレースケール化(sRGB相対輝度)"
msgstr "Convert fills and strokes to greyscale, by sRGB relative luminance"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:86 src/migration/wkhtmltopdf-options.md:51
msgid "`--no-pdf-compression`"
msgstr "`--no-pdf-compression`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:86
msgid "PDFオブジェクトのFlate圧縮を止める(画像データは対象外)"
msgstr "Turn off Flate compression of PDF objects; image data is unaffected"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:88
msgid "`/Producer`と`/CreationDate`は常に書かれます。"
msgstr "`/Producer` and `/CreationDate` are always written."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:90
msgid "グレースケールの限界"
msgstr "The limits of greyscale"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:92
msgid ""
"JPEG(`/DCTDecode`のパススルー)とCMYK画像はデコーダを持たないため、変換されず"
"カラーのまま残ります。"
msgstr ""
"JPEG images, which pass through as `/DCTDecode`, and CMYK images have no "
"decoder here, so they stay in colour."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:94
msgid "コンテンツの挙動"
msgstr "What gets drawn"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:98
msgid "`--no-images`"
msgstr "`--no-images`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:98
msgid "`<img>`とCSS`background-image`を読み込まない"
msgstr "Do not load `<img>` or the CSS `background-image`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:99
msgid "`--no-background`"
msgstr "`--no-background`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:99
msgid "要素の背景(色・画像)を描かない"
msgstr "Do not paint element backgrounds, neither colour nor image"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:100
msgid "`--user-style-sheet <PATH>`"
msgstr "`--user-style-sheet <PATH>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:100
msgid "ユーザーオリジンのCSS(複数指定可)。UAスタイルより強く、著者CSSより弱い"
msgstr ""
"CSS in the user origin; may be given more than once. Stronger than the UA "
"stylesheet, weaker than the author's CSS"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:101
msgid "`--minimum-font-size <PX>`"
msgstr "`--minimum-font-size <PX>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:101
msgid "算出`font-size`の下限"
msgstr "A lower bound on the computed `font-size`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:102
msgid "`--disable-external-links`"
msgstr "`--disable-external-links`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:102
msgid "外部リンク(http(s))のPDF注釈を作らない"
msgstr "Do not create PDF annotations for external http(s) links"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:103
msgid "`--disable-internal-links`"
msgstr "`--disable-internal-links`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:103
msgid "内部リンク(`#id`)のPDF注釈を作らない"
msgstr "Do not create PDF annotations for internal `#id` links"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:104
msgid "`--keep-relative-links`"
msgstr "`--keep-relative-links`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:104
msgid "相対URLの外部リンクを絶対化せずそのまま書く"
msgstr ""
"Write relative external links as they are, without making them absolute"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:105
msgid "`--load-media-error-handling <ignore\\|abort>`"
msgstr "`--load-media-error-handling <ignore\\|abort>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:105
msgid "画像・CSS・フォントの取得失敗時の挙動(既定`ignore`)"
msgstr ""
"What to do when an image, stylesheet, or font cannot be fetched; `ignore` by "
"default"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:107
msgid "ヘッダー/フッター"
msgstr "Headers and footers"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:109
msgid ""
"2つの方法があります。 同じ側に両方を指定した場合は`--header-html`が優先されま"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"There are two ways to do this. If both are given for the same side, `--"
"header-html` wins."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:112
msgid "1. テキストで指定する"
msgstr "1. As text"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:114
msgid "`@page`のmargin boxへマップされます。"
msgstr "These map onto the margin boxes of `@page`."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:116
msgid ""
"```\n"
"sghtmltopdf report.html \\\n"
"  --header-center \"四半期レポート\" \\\n"
"  --footer-right \"[page] / [topage]\" \\\n"
"  --header-line\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"sghtmltopdf report.html \\\n"
"  --header-center \"Quarterly report\" \\\n"
"  --footer-right \"[page] / [topage]\" \\\n"
"  --header-line\n"
"```"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:125
msgid "`--header-left` / `--header-center` / `--header-right <TEXT>`"
msgstr "`--header-left`, `--header-center`, `--header-right <TEXT>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:125
msgid "ヘッダーの3分割位置"
msgstr "The three positions across the header"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:126
msgid "`--footer-left` / `--footer-center` / `--footer-right <TEXT>`"
msgstr "`--footer-left`, `--footer-center`, `--footer-right <TEXT>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:126
msgid "フッターの3分割位置"
msgstr "The three positions across the footer"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:127 src/migration/wkhtmltopdf-options.md:129
msgid "`--header-font-name` / `--header-font-size`"
msgstr "`--header-font-name`, `--header-font-size`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:127
msgid "ヘッダーのフォント(footerも同様)"
msgstr "The header font; the footer has the same pair"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:128
msgid "`--header-line` / `--footer-line`"
msgstr "`--header-line`, `--footer-line`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:128
msgid "罫線を引く"
msgstr "Draw a rule"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:129
msgid "`--header-spacing` / `--footer-spacing <MM>`"
msgstr "`--header-spacing`, `--footer-spacing <MM>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:129
msgid "本文との間隔。その分だけマージンが増える"
msgstr "The gap from the body text; the margin grows by that much"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:130 src/migration/wkhtmltopdf-options.md:86
msgid "`--default-header`"
msgstr "`--default-header`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:130
msgid "タイトルとページ番号の既定ヘッダー"
msgstr "A default header with the title and the page number"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:131
msgid "`--replace <NAME=VALUE>`"
msgstr "`--replace <NAME=VALUE>`"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:131
msgid "任意の`[NAME]`を値へ置換(複数指定可)"
msgstr "Replace any `[NAME]` with a value; may be given more than once"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:133
msgid ""
"プレースホルダは`[page]`(現在ページ)・`[topage]`(総ページ数)・`[frompage]`・"
"`[title]`/`[doctitle]`・`[date]`・`[time]`、および`--replace`で定義した名前で"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"The placeholders are `[page]` for the current page, `[topage]` for the total "
"page count, `[frompage]`, `[title]` and `[doctitle]`, `[date]`, `[time]`, "
"and any name you define with `--replace`."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:135
msgid ""
"`[section]`/`[subsection]`と`[webpage]`/`[sitepage]`/`[sitepages]`は非対応で"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"`[section]`, `[subsection]`, `[webpage]`, `[sitepage]`, and `[sitepages]` "
"are not supported."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:137
msgid "2. HTMLで指定する"
msgstr "2. As HTML"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:143
msgid ""
"各ページの余白領域へ、別のHTMLをレンダリングして合成します。 プレースホルダは"
"HTMLのテキストとして置換されます(JavaScriptは実行しません)。"
msgstr ""
"A separate HTML file is rendered into the margin area of every page. "
"Placeholders are substituted in the HTML as text; JavaScript is not executed."

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:146
msgid "余白に入りきらない分はクリップされます(マージンは自動で広がりません)"
msgstr ""
"Anything that does not fit in the margin is clipped; the margin does not "
"grow to accommodate it"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:147
msgid ""
"外部リソースを取得しません。使えるのはインラインの`<style>`・テキスト・枠線・"
"背景色までで、`<img>`と外部CSSは非対応です"
msgstr ""
"No external resources are fetched. Inline `<style>`, text, borders, and "
"background colours work; `<img>` and external CSS do not"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:148
msgid ""
"ヘッダー/フッターHTML内の`@font-face`は読み込みません。そこでしか使わないフォ"
"ントは`--font`で明示してください"
msgstr ""
"`@font-face` inside the header or footer HTML is not loaded. Name any font "
"used only there with `--font`"

