msgstr ""
"Rendering error, such as breaking one of the streaming mode restrictions"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:247
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: src/usage/cli/reference.md:247
msgid ""
"制限時間超過(HTTPサーバモードの`--timeout`のみ。CLIには時間制限がないため出ま"
"せん)"
msgstr ""
"Time limit exceeded (HTTP server mode's `--timeout` only; the CLI has no "
"time limit, so this never appears)"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:3
msgid ""
"`--streaming`を付けると、HTMLをチャンク単位で読みながら、ページが確定したそば"
"からPDFを書き出して、そのページ分のメモリを手放します。"
msgstr ""
"With `--streaming`, the HTML is read in chunks, each page is written to the "
"PDF as soon as its layout is final, and the memory that page used is "
"released."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:9
msgid ""
"数万要素規模のHTMLで効果があります([メモリと処理時間](#メモリと処理時間))。 "
"その代わり、文書全体を見ないと決まらないものが使えなくなります。"
msgstr ""
"It pays off for HTML with tens of thousands of elements (see [Memory and "
"processing time](#memory-and-processing-time)). In exchange, anything that "
"cannot be decided without seeing the whole document becomes unavailable."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:12
msgid "使えないもの(エラーになる)"
msgstr "Not available (these are errors)"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:14
msgid "指定するとexit code 3で終了します。"
msgstr "Passing any of these exits with code 3."

