msgstr "`counter(pages)`, and `[topage]` in headers and footers"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:18
msgid "総ページ数は1パスでは決まらない"
msgstr "The total page count is not known in a single pass"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:19
msgid "同上(目次には本文のページ番号が要る)"
msgstr "Same reason; a table of contents needs the page numbers of the body"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:20
msgid "`<html>`/`<body>`自身の背景色・枠線"
msgstr "A background colour or border on `<html>` or `<body>` itself"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:20
msgid "複数ページにまたがる装飾の再現が必要になる"
msgstr "That decoration would have to be reproduced across every page"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:21
msgid "`<body>`より後の`<style>` / `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">`"
msgstr "`<style>` or `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">` after `<body>`"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:21
msgid "既に書き出したページへ遡って適用できない"
msgstr "It cannot be applied retroactively to pages that are already written"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:23
msgid "警告のうえ続行するもの"
msgstr "Warned about, but processing continues"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:25
msgid "結果が変わるため、黙って進めずに警告を出します。"
msgstr ""
"These change the result, so a warning is printed rather than passing over "
"them silently."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:27
msgid "制約"
msgstr "Limitation"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:27 src/supports/fonts.md:105
msgid "挙動"
msgstr "Behaviour"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:29
msgid "`font-family`名からのシステムフォント自動探索"
msgstr "Finding a system font from a `font-family` name"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:29
msgid ""
"既定のフォントで描画する。`--font`/`--gothic-font`/`--serif-font`/`--mono-"
"font`か`@font-face`で明示すれば解決できる"
msgstr ""
"The default font is used instead. Naming the font with `--font`, `--gothic-"
"font`, `--serif-font`, `--mono-font`, or `@font-face` resolves it."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:30
msgid "文字を描画できるフォントのシステム探索"
msgstr "Searching the system for a font that can draw a given character"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:30
msgid ""
"文書全体を先読みできないため行わない。フォントを1つも指定しなかった場合だけ、"
"CJK用のフォントを1本先回りで読み込む([フォント](../../supports/fonts.md#スト"
"リーミングモードでの注意))。描画できない文字が出たら文字ごとに警告する"
msgstr ""
"Not done, because the whole document cannot be read ahead. Only when no font "
"at all is given, one CJK font is loaded up front (see [Fonts](../../supports/"
"fonts.md#a-note-on-streaming-mode)). Characters that cannot be drawn are "
"reported one by one."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:31
msgid ""
"`:last-of-type`・`:only-of-type`・`:nth-last-child()`・`:nth-last-of-"
"type()`・`:has(~ ...)`"
msgstr ""
"`:last-of-type`, `:only-of-type`, `:nth-last-child()`, `:nth-last-of-"
"type()`, `:has(~ ...)`"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:31
msgid "結果が変わる(余分にマッチする、または取りこぼす)"
msgstr "The result changes: they match too much, or miss altogether"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:33
msgid ""
"`<body>`直下の要素は、次の兄弟が現れた時点でスタイルを確定させます。 そのため"
"「この先に同じ型の要素が続くか」を要求するセレクタだけが判定できません。 「最"
"後の要素だけ罫線を消す」といった指定は、クラスを振って`.last { … }`のように書"
"き換えてください。"
msgstr ""
"An element directly under `<body>` has its style settled the moment its next "
"sibling appears. Only selectors that need to know whether more elements of "
"the same kind follow are therefore undecidable. Rewrite rules such as "
"\"remove the rule on the last row only\" by adding a class and writing `."
"last { … }` instead."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:37
msgid ""
"これ以外の兄弟セレクタ(`+`・`~`・`:first-child`・`:nth-child()`・`:last-"
"child`など)はバッチと同じ結果になります。 詳細は[セレクタ](../../supports/"
"selectors.md#ストリーミングモード固有の制約)を参照してください。"
msgstr ""
"Every other sibling selector — `+`, `~`, `:first-child`, `:nth-child()`, `:"
"last-child` and so on — gives the same result as batch mode. See [Selectors]"
"(../../supports/selectors.md#restrictions-specific-to-streaming-mode) for "
"the details."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:40
msgid "使えるもの"
msgstr "Still available"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:42
msgid "以下はストリーミングモードでも通常どおり使えます。"
msgstr "The following work exactly as they do in the normal mode."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:44
msgid "`--cover`(表紙)"
msgstr "`--cover`, the cover page"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:45
