"ピークメモリはプロセスの最大常駐セットサイズ(RSS)。2回実行して良いほうの値"
msgstr ""
"Peak memory is the maximum resident set size (RSS) of the process, taking "
"the better of two runs"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:77
msgid "いつ使うか"
msgstr "When to use it"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:79
msgid "数千ページ規模の帳票を1本のHTMLから出す"
msgstr ""
"Producing a statement of several thousand pages from a single HTML file"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:80
msgid "メモリの上限が厳しい環境(コンテナのメモリ制限、サーバレス)で動かす"
msgstr ""
"Running where memory is tightly capped, such as under a container limit or "
"on a serverless platform"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:82
msgid ""
"逆に、数十ページの請求書のような文書では通常モードで十分です。 制約を負ってま"
"で使うものではありません。"
msgstr ""
"For a document of a few dozen pages, such as an invoice, the normal mode is "
"fine. There is no reason to take on the limitations."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:85
msgid ""
"[サーバモード](../server.md)では、クエリに`streaming`を付けると同じモードにな"
"ります。 `?stream=1`(chunkedで返す)と組み合わせると、入力・レンダリング・出力"
"のすべてが逐次処理になります。"
msgstr ""
"In [server mode](../server.md) the same mode is selected by adding "
"`streaming` to the query. Combined with `?stream=1`, which returns the body "
"chunked, input, rendering, and output all become incremental."

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:89
msgid "'http://127.0.0.1:8080/pdf?stream=1&streaming'"
msgstr "'http://127.0.0.1:8080/pdf?stream=1&streaming'"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:92
msgid "ストリーミング時の処理の流れ"
msgstr "How streaming works"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:94
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TD\n"
"    A[\"HTMLチャンク\"] --> B[\"ストリーミングパーサ\"]\n"
"    B --> C[\"スタイルカスケード\"]\n"
"    C --> D[\"レイアウト + ページ分割\"]\n"
"    D --> E[\"PDFライター\"]\n"
"    E --> F[\"PDF出力\"]\n"
"    D -. \"ページが確定するたび\" .-> E\n"
"    E -. \"メモリを解放して読み進む\" .-> B\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TD\n"
"    A[\"HTML chunk\"] --> B[\"Streaming parser\"]\n"
"    B --> C[\"Style cascade\"]\n"
"    C --> D[\"Layout + pagination\"]\n"
"    D --> E[\"PDF writer\"]\n"
"    E --> F[\"PDF output\"]\n"
"    D -. \"on every settled page\" .-> E\n"
"    E -. \"free the memory and read on\" .-> B\n"
"```"

#: src/usage/cli/streaming.md:105
msgid ""
"ページの区切りが確定した時点でPDFを書き出し、そのページ分のメモリを解放して先"
"へ読み進めることで、大きな文書でも消費メモリを増やさず処理を可能にしていま"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"As soon as a page boundary is final, that page is written to the PDF and the "
"memory it used is released before reading on, which is how large documents "
"are processed without memory use growing."

