msgstr ""
"Global configuration is merged first and the arguments at the call site win. "
"`Sghtmltopdf.reset_config!` clears it again, mainly for tests."

#: src/usage/ruby_rails.md:97
msgid ""
"指定しなければシステムのフォントが使われるため、出力が実行環境に依存します。 "
"コンテナのフォント事情に左右されたくない場合は明示してください。"
msgstr ""
"Without a font setting, the system fonts are used and the output depends on "
"the environment. Name the fonts explicitly if you do not want to be at the "
"mercy of what a container happens to have."

#: src/usage/ruby_rails.md:102
