"`formats` `variants` `handlers` `prefixes` `object` `collection` `assigns` "
"`action`"

#: src/usage/ruby_rails.md:152
msgid "レスポンスの組み立て"
msgstr "Used to build the response"

#: src/usage/ruby_rails.md:152
msgid "`disposition`(既定`inline`) `filename` `status`"
msgstr "`disposition` (`inline` by default), `filename`, `status`"

#: src/usage/ruby_rails.md:153
