msgid "⚠️"
msgstr "⚠️"

#: src/supports/properties.md:22
msgid ""
"`block`/`inline`/`inline-block`/`list-item`/`table`/`table-row`/`table-cell`/"
"`table-caption`/`flex`/`none`のみ。`grid`は対応([Grid](#grid)節)。`inline-"
"flex`/`inline-grid`・`table-row-group`等のテーブル内部値・`flow-root`は非対"
"応。`<thead>`/`<tbody>`/`<tfoot>`はUAスタイルで`block`のままだが、行収集が透"
"過するのでテーブルとして機能する"
msgstr ""
"`block`, `inline`, `inline-block`, `list-item`, `table`, `table-row`, `table-"
"cell`, `table-caption`, `flex`, and `none` only. `grid` is supported; see "
"the [Grid](#grid) section. `inline-flex`, `inline-grid`, the internal table "
"values such as `table-row-group`, and `flow-root` are not. `<thead>`, "
"`<tbody>`, and `<tfoot>` stay `block` in the UA stylesheet, but row "
"collection sees through them, so tables still work"

#: src/supports/properties.md:23
msgid "`visibility`"
msgstr "`visibility`"

#: src/supports/properties.md:23
msgid ""
"`visible`/`hidden`/`collapse`。`collapse`は`hidden`と同一視(テーブル行/列の高"
"さ再計算はしない)。継承プロパティ"
msgstr ""
"`visible`, `hidden`, and `collapse`. `collapse` is treated as `hidden`; "
"table row and column sizes are not recomputed. Inherited"

#: src/supports/properties.md:24
msgid "`overflow`"
msgstr "`overflow`"

#: src/supports/properties.md:24
msgid ""
"`visible`以外(`hidden`/`scroll`/`auto`)は区別せず一律クリップ。スクロールバー"
"の概念は無い。`overflow-x`/`overflow-y`は非対応"
msgstr ""
"Anything other than `visible`, that is `hidden`, `scroll`, and `auto`, clips "
"alike; they are not told apart. There is no notion of a scrollbar. `overflow-"
"x` and `overflow-y` are not supported"

#: src/supports/properties.md:25
msgid "`opacity`"
msgstr "`opacity`"

#: src/supports/properties.md:25
msgid ""
"`<number>`/`<percentage>`を0〜1にクランプ。PDFの透明グループ+ExtGStateで実"
"装。要素単位の合成で、`mix-blend-mode`等のブレンドは非対応"
msgstr ""
"`<number>` or `<percentage>`, clamped to 0 through 1. Implemented with a PDF "
"transparency group and an ExtGState. Compositing is per element; blending "
"such as `mix-blend-mode` is not supported"

#: src/supports/properties.md:26
msgid "`z-index`"
msgstr "`z-index`"

#: src/supports/properties.md:26
msgid ""
"`auto`/`<integer>`。`position: relative`の要素にのみ効く(仕様では他の"
"positioned要素にも効く)。同じ親を持つ兄弟間の描画順のみを制御し、スタッキング"
"コンテキストの分離は非対応。絶対配置要素は常に通常フローの上に描かれる"
msgstr ""
"`auto` or `<integer>`. It only affects `position: relative` elements, "
"whereas the specification applies it to every positioned element. It "
"controls the paint order among siblings of the same parent only; separate "
"stacking contexts are not supported. Absolutely positioned elements always "
"paint above the normal flow"

#: src/supports/properties.md:27
msgid "`box-sizing`"
msgstr "`box-sizing`"

#: src/supports/properties.md:27
msgid "`content-box`/`border-box`。標準外の`padding-box`は非対応"
msgstr ""
"`content-box` and `border-box`. The non-standard `padding-box` is not "
"supported"

#: src/supports/properties.md:29
msgid "ボックスモデル"
msgstr "Box model"

#: src/supports/properties.md:33
msgid "`width` / `height`"
msgstr "`width`, `height`"

#: src/supports/properties.md:33
msgid ""
"`auto`/`<length>`/`<percentage>`/`calc()`。`min-content`/`max-content`/`fit-"
"content`は非対応。`height`のパーセンテージはcontaining block高さ不定として無"
"視される"
msgstr ""
"`auto`, `<length>`, `<percentage>`, and `calc()`. `min-content`, `max-"
"content`, and `fit-content` are not supported. A percentage `height` is "
"ignored, since the containing block's height is treated as indefinite"

#: src/supports/properties.md:34
msgid "`min-width` / `min-height`"
msgstr "`min-width`, `min-height`"

#: src/supports/properties.md:34
msgid ""
"`<length>`/`<percentage>`/`calc()`(初期値`0`)。`auto`/`min-content`等のキー"
"ワードは非対応。`min-height`のパーセンテージは無視される"
msgstr ""
"`<length>`, `<percentage>`, and `calc()`; `0` by default. Keywords such as "
"`auto` and `min-content` are not supported. A percentage `min-height` is "
"ignored"

#: src/supports/properties.md:35
msgid "`max-width` / `max-height`"
msgstr "`max-width`, `max-height`"

#: src/supports/properties.md:35
msgid ""
"`none`/`<length>`/`<percentage>`/`calc()`(初期値`none`)。`min > max`のときは"
"`min`が勝つ(仕様通り)。`max-height`のパーセンテージは無視される"
msgstr ""
"`none`, `<length>`, `<percentage>`, and `calc()`; `none` by default. When "
"`min` exceeds `max`, `min` wins, as the specification says. A percentage "
"`max-height` is ignored"

#: src/supports/properties.md:36
msgid "`aspect-ratio`"
msgstr "`aspect-ratio`"

#: src/supports/properties.md:36
msgid ""
"`auto \\| <ratio> \\| auto <ratio>`。「幅確定→高さ導出」が基本で、「高さ確定→"
"幅導出」はfloat/`inline-block`/絶対配置/`<img>`のshrink-to-fit文脈のみ(通常フ"
"ローのブロックの`width: auto`はstretch優先、仕様通り)。`min-*`/`max-*`でクラ"
"ンプされて比が崩れた場合の再計算は行わない"
msgstr ""
"`auto \\| <ratio> \\| auto <ratio>`. The normal direction is width first, "
"height derived. Height first, width derived only happens in shrink-to-fit "
"contexts: floats, `inline-block`, absolute positioning, and `<img>`. A "
"normal-flow block with `width: auto` still stretches, as the specification "
"says. When `min-*` or `max-*` clamping breaks the ratio, nothing is "
"recomputed"

#: src/supports/properties.md:37
msgid "`margin`"
msgstr "`margin`"

