"Teredo `2001::/32`, `2001:db8::/32`, ORCHIDv2 `2001:20::/28`, `100::/64`"

#: src/supports/images.md:209
msgid ""
"IPv4を埋め込むIPv6表記(IPv4-mapped `::ffff:a.b.c.d`、IPv4-compatible `::a.b."
"c.d`、NAT64 `64:ff9b::/96`、6to4 `2002::/16`)は、埋め込まれたIPv4側で判定しま"
