msgstr ""
"IPv6 forms that embed an IPv4 address (IPv4-mapped `::ffff:a.b.c.d`, IPv4-"
"compatible `::a.b.c.d`, NAT64 `64:ff9b::/96`, 6to4 `2002::/16`) are judged "
