#: src/supports/images.md:212
msgid ""
"判定は名前解決の結果に対して行うため、DNSリバインディングやリダイレクト経由の"
"迂回も同じ仕組みで防いでいます。"
msgstr ""
"The check is applied to the result of name resolution, so DNS rebinding and "
"redirect-based bypasses are prevented by the same mechanism."

#: src/supports/images.md:214
msgid ""
"ポート番号は制限しません。 内部サービスはプライベートIP上にあり、そこは上の判"
"定で塞がっています。 公開IPに対する非標準ポート(CDNやAPIの`8080`など)は正当な"
"用途があるため、塞ぐと実用を損なうわりに得るものがありません。"
msgstr "Private"

#: src/supports/images.md:218
msgid ""
"信頼できないHTMLを変換する場合は、`--allow-path`でローカル参照の範囲も併せて"
"絞ってください。"
msgstr ""
"When converting untrusted HTML, narrow the range of local references as well "
"with `--allow-path`."

#: src/supports/images.md:224
msgid "JPEGはそのまま埋め込まれる"
msgstr "JPEG is embedded as is"

#: src/supports/images.md:226
msgid ""
"JPEGはデコードせず、サイズ情報だけを読んでPDFへそのまま(DCTDecodeとして)埋め"
"込みます。 再エンコードしないので画質は落ちず、変換も速くなります。"
msgstr ""
"JPEG images are not decoded. Only their dimensions are read, and the data "
"goes into the PDF unchanged, as `DCTDecode`. Nothing is re-encoded, so "
"quality is preserved and conversion is faster."

#: src/supports/images.md:229
msgid ""
"その代わり、`--grayscale`を指定してもJPEGとCMYK画像はカラーのまま残ります(デ"
"コーダを持たないため)。 グレースケール化が必要な場合は、変換前の画像をグレー"
"スケールにしておいてください。"
msgstr ""
"The trade-off is that `--grayscale` leaves JPEG and CMYK images in colour, "
"since there is no decoder for them. If you need them in greyscale, convert "
"the images before rendering."

#: src/supports/images.md:232
msgid ""
"PNGとWebPはフルデコードし、アルファチャンネルがあれば透過画像として埋め込みま"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"PNG and WebP are fully decoded, and an alpha channel is carried through as "
"transparency."

#: src/supports/images.md:234
msgid "画像を一切読み込まない"
msgstr "Loading no images at all"

#: src/supports/images.md:240
msgid "`<img>`とCSSの`background-image`の両方を読み込まなくなります。"
msgstr ""
"This stops both `<img>` and the CSS `background-image` from being loaded."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:3
msgid "sghtmltopdfはCSS Fragmentationのプロパティでページ分割を制御します。"
msgstr ""
"sghtmltopdf controls page breaks through the CSS Fragmentation properties."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:5
msgid "明示的な改ページ"
msgstr "Explicit page breaks"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:8
msgid "/* この要素の前で改ページ */"
msgstr "/* break before this element */"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:9
msgid "/* この要素の後で改ページ */"
msgstr "/* break after this element */"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:10
msgid "/* この要素をページ境界で割らない */"
msgstr "/* do not split this element across a page boundary */"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:13
msgid "受け付ける値"
msgstr "Accepted values"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:15
msgid ""
"`auto` / `avoid`(`avoid-page`・`avoid-column`も同義) / `always`(`page`も同義)"
msgstr ""
"`auto`, `avoid` (`avoid-page` and `avoid-column` mean the same), `always` "
"(`page` means the same)"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:16
msgid "`auto` / `avoid`(同上)"
msgstr "`auto`, `avoid` (as above)"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:18
msgid ""
"古い`page-break-before` / `page-break-after` / `page-break-inside`もエイリア"
"スとして受け付けます。 wkhtmltopdfやwicked_pdf向けに書いた資産をそのまま持ち"
"込めます。"
msgstr ""
"The older `page-break-before`, `page-break-after`, and `page-break-inside` "
"are accepted as aliases, so stylesheets written for wkhtmltopdf or "
"wicked_pdf carry over unchanged."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:21
msgid ""
"`left`/`right`/`recto`/`verso`(見開き制御)と多段組み関連の値は非対応です。"
msgstr ""
"The spread-related values `left`, `right`, `recto`, and `verso`, and the "
"multi-column values, are not supported."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:23
msgid "CSSを書かずに指定する"
msgstr "Without writing CSS"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:25
msgid "HTML属性でも書けます。"
msgstr "The same thing can be written as an HTML attribute."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:28
msgid "\"before\""
msgstr "\"before\""

#: src/supports/pagination.md:29
msgid "\"after\""
msgstr "\"after\""

#: src/supports/pagination.md:30
msgid "\"avoid\""
msgstr "\"avoid\""

#: src/supports/pagination.md:33
msgid ""
"こちらは弱い優先度のヒントとして扱われるので、スタイルシートのルールで個別に"
"上書きできます。"
msgstr ""
"These count as low-priority hints, so a rule in a stylesheet can override "
"any of them individually."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:35
msgid "段落が泣き別れないようにする"
msgstr "Keeping paragraphs from being split badly"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:39
msgid "/* ページ末尾に最低3行は残す */"
msgstr "/* leave at least three lines at the bottom of the page */"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:40
msgid "/* 次ページの先頭に最低3行は送る */"
msgstr "/* carry at least three lines to the top of the next page */"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:44
msgid ""
"1以上の整数で、初期値はどちらも2です。 指定を満たせない場合は段落ごと次のペー"
"ジへ送られます。"
msgstr ""
"Both take an integer of 1 or more and default to 2. When the requirement "
"cannot be met, the whole paragraph moves to the next page."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:47
msgid "`@page` — 用紙とページ余白"
msgstr "`@page`: paper and page margins"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:54
msgid "\"請求書\""
msgstr "\"Invoice\""

#: src/supports/pagination.md:55
msgid "page"
msgstr "page"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:55
msgid "\" / \""
msgstr "\" / \""

#: src/supports/pagination.md:55
msgid "pages"
msgstr "pages"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:59
msgid "\"表紙\""
msgstr "\"Cover\""

#: src/supports/pagination.md:63
msgid ""
"`size`はページサイズのキーワード(`A4`/`Letter`等)・`<length>{1,2}`・"
"`landscape`/`portrait`を受け付けます"
msgstr ""
"`size` accepts a page size keyword such as `A4` or `Letter`, one or two "
"`<length>` values, and `landscape` or `portrait`"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:64
msgid "CLIのページ設定オプションより`@page`が優先されます(CLI側は初期値)"
msgstr ""
"`@page` wins over the CLI page setup options, which act as initial values"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:65
msgid ""
"margin box(`@top-left-corner`〜`@bottom-right-corner`の16種)には`content`でテ"
"キストを置けます。背景色や枠線などの装飾は非対応です"
msgstr ""
"Text can be placed in the margin boxes, the sixteen from `@top-left-corner` "
"to `@bottom-right-corner`, through `content`. Decoration such as background "
"colours and borders is not supported there"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:66
msgid "`counter(page)`は現在のページ番号、`counter(pages)`は総ページ数です"
msgstr ""
"`counter(page)` is the current page number and `counter(pages)` is the total "
"page count"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:68
msgid "`@page`の制約"
msgstr "Limits of `@page`"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:70
msgid ""
"`size`/`margin`はページごとに変えられません。`:first`/`:left`/`:right`付きの"
"`size`/`margin`宣言はパースされますが適用されず、これらの擬似クラスは margin "
"boxの 内容の出し分けにだけ使えます"
msgstr ""
"`size` and `margin` cannot vary from page to page. Such declarations "
"qualified with `:first`, `:left`, or `:right` are parsed but not applied; "
"those pseudo-classes only serve to vary the contents of the margin boxes"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:71
msgid "名前付きページ(`@page intro`と`page: intro`)は非対応です"
msgstr ""
"Named pages, `@page intro` together with `page: intro`, are not supported"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:72
msgid ""
"margin boxの寸法は簡略化しています。4隅は縦横マージンの交差部分で固定、残り12"
"個は各辺を3等分した均等割りです(`width`指定は無視されます)"
msgstr ""
"The margin box geometry is simplified. The four corners are fixed to where "
"the vertical and horizontal margins meet, and the other twelve divide each "
"edge into three equal parts; a `width` is ignored"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:73
msgid ""
"`counter(pages)`は[ストリーミングモード](../usage/cli/streaming.md)では使えま"
"せん(総ページ数が1パスでは決まらないため)"
msgstr ""
"`counter(pages)` is unavailable in [streaming mode](../usage/cli/streaming."
"md), because the total page count is not known in a single pass"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:75
msgid ""
"CLIの`--header-center`などのオプションは、内部的にこの`@page`のmargin boxへ"
"マップされます。 両方書いた場合はCSSが勝ちます。"
msgstr ""
"CLI options such as `--header-center` are mapped internally onto these "
"`@page` margin boxes. If you write both, the CSS wins."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:78
msgid "テーブルのページ分割"
msgstr "Breaking tables across pages"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:80
msgid "1ページに収まらないテーブルは行単位で分割され、複数ページへ流れます。"
msgstr ""
"A table that does not fit on one page is split row by row and flows across "
"pages."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:82
msgid ""
"`<thead>`の行は2ページ目以降の先頭に繰り返されます。複数行の見出しにも対応"
"し、1ページに収まる表では複製しません"
msgstr ""
"The rows of `<thead>` are repeated at the top of every page after the first. "
"Multi-row headers work too, and nothing is repeated for a table that fits on "
"one page"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:83
msgid ""
"`<tfoot>`はソース順に関わらずテーブル末尾へ移動しますが、各ページ下端への繰り"
"返しは行いません(最終ページに1回だけ出ます)"
msgstr ""
"`<tfoot>` moves to the end of the table regardless of where it appears in "
"the source, but it is not repeated at the bottom of every page; it appears "
"once, on the last page"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:84
msgid ""
"`caption`は`caption-side`に従って、最初(`top`)または最後(`bottom`)の断片に付"
"きます"
msgstr ""
"The `caption` goes with the first fragment for `caption-side: top` and with "
"the last for `bottom`"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:85
msgid ""
"各断片はテーブル自身の背景・枠線を引き継ぎ、`border-collapse: collapse`の枠線"
"統合もページ内でそのまま効きます"
msgstr ""
"Every fragment carries the table's own background and borders, and `border-"
"collapse: collapse` still merges borders within each page"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:87
msgid ""
"既知の限界として、`rowspan`が分割点をまたぐセルは開始行の断片に属し、下部が"
"ページからはみ出します(クリップされません)。 行単位の`break-inside: avoid`と"
"orphans/widows相当も未対応です。"
msgstr ""
"As a known limitation, a cell whose `rowspan` crosses a break belongs to the "
"fragment of its starting row and its lower part runs off the page without "
"being clipped. Row-level `break-inside: avoid` and the equivalent of orphans "
"and widows are not supported either."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:90
msgid "FlexboxとGridの扱い"
msgstr "How Flexbox and Grid are handled"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:92
msgid "レイアウト"
msgstr "Layout"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:94
msgid "`display: flex`"
msgstr "`display: flex`"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:94
msgid ""
"収まればアトミック(途中で分割せず、次ページへ送る)。1ページに収まらない高さの"
"コンテナは、縦に重ならないアイテム群(列flexなら各アイテム、折り返す行flexなら"
"各flex line)を単位に分割し、アイテムが1つだけの帯はブロックと同様に内部でも分"
"割する"
msgstr ""
"Atomic when it fits (never split; moved to the next page whole). A container "
"taller than one page is split in units of bands, groups of items that do not "
"overlap vertically (each item of a column flex, each flex line of a wrapping "
"row flex); a band holding a single item is split inside as well, like a block"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:95
msgid "`display: grid`"
msgstr "`display: grid`"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:95
msgid "行単位で分割する(複数行にまたがるアイテムがある境界では分割しない)"
msgstr ""
"Split row band by row band, except at a boundary crossed by an item that "
"spans rows"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:96
msgid "`display: table`"
msgstr "`display: table`"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:96
msgid "行単位で分割する(上記)"
msgstr "Split row by row, as above"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:98
msgid ""
"大きなカードを並べる用途では、flexコンテナが丸ごと次ページへ飛ぶことがありま"
"す。 分割してほしい場合はGridかテーブルを使ってください。"
msgstr ""
"When laying out large cards, a flex container can jump to the next page in "
"one piece. Use Grid or a table where you want it split."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:101
msgid ""
"1ページに収まらないflexコンテナ(列flexで組んだ文書本文など)は、はみ出した部分"
"を失わずに後続ページへ流れます。 折り返さない行flexで1ページより高いflex line"
"は分割できず、はみ出します(クリップされません)。"
msgstr ""
"A flex container that does not fit on one page (a document body laid out as "
"a column flex, say) flows onto the following pages without losing the "
"overflow. A flex line taller than one page in a row flex that does not wrap "
"cannot be split and overflows (it is not clipped)."

#: src/supports/pagination.md:104
msgid "よく使う書き方"
msgstr "Common patterns"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:106
msgid "見出しが単独でページ末尾に残らないようにする:"
msgstr "Keep a heading from being stranded at the bottom of a page:"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:110
msgid "/* 見出しの直後で改ページしない */"
msgstr "/* do not break right after a heading */"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:115
msgid "明細の1件が2ページに割れないようにする:"
msgstr "Keep a single line item from splitting across two pages:"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:121
msgid "章ごとに必ず改ページする:"
msgstr "Always start a new page for each chapter:"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:127
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Note"

#: src/supports/pagination.md:129
msgid ""
"[ストリーミングモード](../usage/cli/streaming.md)では`:last-child`などの後方"
"参照セレクタが常に非マッチになります。 上の例の`+`(隣接兄弟)は使えます。"
msgstr ""
"In [streaming mode](../usage/cli/streaming.md), selectors that look "
"backwards, such as `:last-child`, never match. The adjacent sibling "
"combinator `+` used above does work."

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:3
msgid ""
"オプション名の多くはwkhtmltopdfと同じです。 ただし同じ名前でも結果が違うもの"
"がいくつかあるので、確認してください。"
msgstr ""
"Most option names are the same as in wkhtmltopdf. A few of them behave "
"differently despite the shared name, so it is worth going through this page."

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:6
msgid ""
"全オプションの対応状況は[wkhtmltopdfオプション対応表](wkhtmltopdf-options.md)"
"にあります。 Railsでwicked_pdf経由で使っている場合は[wicked_pdfからの移行]"
"(wicked-pdf.md)を参照してください。"
msgstr ""
"The [wkhtmltopdf option mapping](wkhtmltopdf-options.md) covers every "
"option. If you use it from Rails through wicked_pdf, see [Migrating from "
"wicked_pdf](wicked-pdf.md)."

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:9
