msgstr "Stops with exit code 1 and explains why"

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:21
msgid "`@page`が勝つ"
msgstr "`@page` wins"

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:23
msgid ""
"もっとも引っかかりやすい違いです。 CSSに`@page { margin: 0 }`と書いてあると、"
"`--margin-top 20mm`は無視されます。"
msgstr ""
"This is the difference people trip over most. If the CSS says `@page "
"{ margin: 0 }`, then `--margin-top 20mm` is ignored."

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:27
msgid "/* こちらが勝つ */"
msgstr "/* this one wins */"

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:30
msgid ""
"CLIオプションは「CSSに書かれていなかったときの初期値」として働きます。 CLIで"
"制御したい場合は、HTMLから`@page`の該当プロパティを外してください。"
msgstr ""
"The CLI options act as initial values for whatever the CSS does not set. To "
"drive it from the CLI, remove the corresponding property from `@page` in the "
"HTML."

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:35
msgid ""
"wkhtmltopdfは四辺10mm、sghtmltopdfは四辺1インチ(96px = 25.4mm)です。 "
"wkhtmltopdfの`--extended-help`は左右にしか既定値を書いていませんが、実際には"
"上下にも10mmが入ります。 指定なしで変換すると余白が変わるので、既存の見た目を"
"保つには明示します。"
msgstr ""
"wkhtmltopdf uses 10mm on all four sides, sghtmltopdf 1 inch (96px, or "
"25.4mm). wkhtmltopdf's `--extended-help` only documents a default for the "
"left and right margins, but the binary applies 10mm to the top and bottom as "
"well. Converting without saying anything therefore changes the margins, so "
"state them to keep the existing look."

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:47
msgid "# wkhtmltopdf\n"
msgstr "# wkhtmltopdf\n"

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:48
msgid "# sghtmltopdf\n"
msgstr "# sghtmltopdf\n"

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:51
msgid ""
"目次の見た目はwkhtmltopdfの既定TOC XSLの出力に合わせてあります。 XSLTは非対応"
"なので、変更は`--user-style-sheet`のCSSで行います。"
msgstr ""
"The table of contents is styled to match what wkhtmltopdf's default TOC XSL "
"produces. XSLT is not supported, so change it with CSS through `--user-style-"
"sheet`."

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:54
msgid "ヘッダー/フッターのページ番号"
msgstr "Page numbers in headers and footers"

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:56
msgid ""
"wkhtmltopdfは`--header-html`のURLにクエリ(`?page=1&topage=5`)を付け、ページ側"
"のJavaScriptで差し込む方式でした。 JSを実行しないので、sghtmltopdfはプレース"
"ホルダの文字列置換に置き換えています。"
msgstr ""
"wkhtmltopdf appended a query such as `?page=1&topage=5` to the `--header-"
"html` URL and let JavaScript on that page insert the values. Since "
"JavaScript is not executed here, sghtmltopdf substitutes placeholders as "
"text instead."

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:60
msgid "\"[page] / [topage]\""
msgstr "\"[page] / [topage]\""

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:63
msgid ""
"HTMLでヘッダーを作る場合も、HTMLのテキストとして`[page]`が置換されます。"
msgstr ""
"When the header is built in HTML, `[page]` is likewise substituted in the "
"HTML as text."

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:65
msgid "非対応のオプションは黙って無視しない"
msgstr "Unsupported options are never ignored silently"

#: src/migration/wkhtmltopdf.md:67
msgid ""
"指定すると理由と代替手段を示して`exit 1`で終了します。 移行時に「オプションが"
"効いていないことに気づかない」事故を避けるためです。"
msgstr ""
"Passing one exits with `exit 1`, explaining why and what to use instead. "
